# Updated: 2026-07-23 (branch feat/video7-gaps, commit 43b902c + merge 332188c)

## Shipped on feat/video7-gaps (context for remaining items)

- 14.1 Processor Workflow: CX.NONDEL.INV.APPROVAL replaced with verified CUST42FV
  (dropdown enum uppercase YES/NO; agent writes "NO").
- 14.2 Processor Closing: field 763 (Est Closing Date) is the source of truth —
  only blank/mismatched Signing (CUST50FV) / Wire (CX.WIREDATELO) dates are
  written from it; 763 never written; Michigan wire exception kept. Certifications:
  CX.VESTINGVERIFTITLE/BOR always "X"; CX.WIREINSTINFILE / CX.ESCROWEOINFILE /
  CX.CPLINFILE checked from live eFolder bucket listing (fuzzy title match);
  CX.HOIEFFECTIVE + CX.TAXES never auto-written (manual-entry rows).
- 14.3 update_processing_submitted (NEW): "In Processing/Submitted" milestone via
  v1 API (GET/PATCH /encompass/v1/loans/{id}/milestones/{mid}). Assigns Loan
  Processor (Ash Desai, user id "adesai"). "Finished" checkbox = milestone
  doneIndicator via ?action=finish — NOT field 1057 (that is "Borr Declarations E").
  FINISH_MODE="probe": attempts finish only to collect the server-side
  missing-required-fields validation (the EC UI "Go To Fields" list), unfinishes
  immediately if it passes. PATCH body must include startDate (client handles).
- 14.4 = build_action_items (renumbered from 14.3).
- 11.1: fields 1551 (community lending CHECKBOX — there is NO "08 Home Ready"
  dropdown) and 1552 (Home Buyers Education Certification dropdown) surfaced as
  manual-entry rows; never auto-written.
- NEW state channel `manual_fields` (rows the agent deliberately did not write;
  deduped by substep+field_id) + `_manual_field` helper + ManualField contract in
  shared/contracts.py (AgentOutput.manual_fields).
- NEW `python3.11 -m factory export-field-schema --env Prod` →
  output/config/field_writes_config.json (format/readOnly/options for 295/305
  registered fields; drives dashboard input controls).
- NEW LangGraph endpoints in langgraph.json: `write_los_fields` (flat overrides,
  audited via write_fields_resilient, ledger source="dashboard-override") and
  `write_los_collections` (VOD collection PATCH, per-row VOL PATCH, contacts
  upsert). Both in output/write_graphs.py, LLM-free single-node graphs.

