## Notes / gotchas

- v3 /loans/{id}/associates and v3 settings/milestones + businessRules → 403
  for our API user; v1 milestones is the working path.
- A loan open in the EC UI is locked: milestone PATCH → 409 EBS-4360. The 14.3
  tool detects this and flags "Loan Locked — Milestone Writes Skipped".
- field 218 + 9 custom fields (CX.AMI.*, CX.KM.CL.*, etc.) are not in the prod
  schema APIs — marked found_in_schema:false in field_writes_config.json.
